From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:48:15 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] server: keep the prompt cache on disk across restarts

A finished prompt is written under the llama.cpp cache directory and restored when it keeps more of the cached sequence than the copy already in RAM. LLAMA_WARM_DISK=0 turns the copy off.
---
